# Example request for the catalog API (FR-16), for the VS Code REST Client extension.
# Start the API and seed the database first (`DEMO_MODE=true pnpm db:seed`). The API listens on 127.0.0.1 only (ADR-0003).

@base = http://127.0.0.1:4000

### Every service, active or retired, by slug; `embedded` says whether search can find it
GET {{base}}/services
